<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 179-3 V WEST INDIES - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 179-3 V WEST INDIES - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain prevented any play between lunch and tea on the final day of the second and final test between West Indies and Sri Lanka on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka, chasing 269 runs for victory, were then 179 for three in their second innings.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 343, Sri Lanka 222 and 179-3 (A.De Silva 76 not out).</p>
</text>
